EmailTemplate.textOnly:
Hello,

We have been attempting to reach you regarding payment on your account. A Legal Demand has been issued for non-payment. We would like to resolve this matter with you. If you are unable to maintain full payments at this time, please contact us to make arrangements and move the account out of default.


Thank you,

{!User.Name} | {!User.Title}

{!Case.Email_Signature_Company__c}

{!$Setup.Company_Information__c.Street__c}
{!$Setup.Company_Information__c.City__c}, {!$Setup.Company_Information__c.State__c} {!$Setup.Company_Information__c.Zip__c}
P: {!User.Phone} | F: {!User.Fax}
E: {!User.Email}
